   353	           MOVE WS-B2 TO LB-2
   354	           MOVE WS-B3 TO LB-3
   355	           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-BANDS
   356	           MOVE WS-USAGE TO LC-USAGE
   357	           MOVE WS-STANDING TO LC-STANDING
   358	           WRITE OUT-REC FROM L-CHARGE
